      "content": "Experiments on the WebArena-Lite benchmark demonstrate the effectiveness of WebAgent-R1. The framework significantly outperforms existing methods, with success rates increasing from 6.1% to 33.9% for Qwen2.5-3B and from 8.5% to 44.8% for Llama3.1-8B. These results highlight the potential of end-to-end multi-turn reinforcement learning for training web agents.",
